rule season v1
description "A price by day and age, the age left out by some: no row for the second half of the season, nor for those of 13 and over in the first"

inputs
  day : date     range >=2026-04-01 <=2026-09-30
  age : number?  range >=0 <=120

outputs
  price : money[JPY]  round down(1JPY)

table prices
| day         | age  | -> price |
| <2026-07-01 | none | 900JPY   |
| <2026-07-01 | <13  | 500JPY   |
